bluejetty:00123936:ios.description:
By waking up in a luxurious mansion you soon realize that its walls are going to be your jail. Here languish the prisoners of the mysterious Puppeteer, who cleverly manipulates the threads of their fate. He won’t leave you alone: serious challenges wait for everyone who wishes to taste the sweet air of freedom. As you move from room to room in this manor, you will discover new items in its opulent environments and learn the amazing and, sometimes, blood-chilling, past of the ancient walls. 
Dive into the mystic noir detective atmosphere in this fascinating hidden objects game. The Victorian-style manor, where you are not a guest, you are a prisoner, holds many secrets. In order to make a way out you will have to unveil all the mysteries the owner of this house calling himself the Puppeteer, who is holding in his hands your life and your freedom.
Various puzzles, quests and game modes, high-detailed graphics and music perfectly fitting the virtual environment, friends and enemies, dramatic plot twists and breathtaking discoveries — everything is set for your head-spinning hidden object adventure. This isn’t a simple quest, this is something much greater...
Features:
- A detective storyline with 2 alternative plots; 
- Realistic graphics and authentic sound;
- Looking for items, completing collections, solving puzzles — a full set of hidden object-related activities;
- Over 3500 plot quests;
- 19 unique characters with personal backgrounds divided into 2 rival factions; 
- 19 highly detailed locations and 13 game modes;
- Advanced social integration — share success with friends, offer and accept help from other players; 
- Regular in-game events and promotional actions by the developers;
- 5 seasons of exciting adventure already experienced by millions of players all over the world!

